        <section id="good-coding-principles-and-practices"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Good coding principles and practices
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>There are many different coding principles that can be used by developers. They will help to decrease complexity and using them can significantly reduce development time and assist with ongoing maintenance.</p>
<p>Two of the main coding principles that are used in the industry today are:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>The KISS principle</strong> – an acronym which stands for ‘Keep it Simple and Straightforward’</li>
<li><strong>S O L I D</strong> - is a mnemonic acronym used for the five design principles which are intended to make programs more understandable, flexible and maintainable.</li>
</ul>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/cp3/cp3_u2_s2_p1_image.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
